@name     args_to_data
@alias    a>d
@group    data
@c_name   skode_clause_args_to_data_1
@type     immediate
@arity    1
@match    (any)
@summary  arguments become the data array
@doc
Replaces the data array with the arguments (the previous array moves to the swap position).
Usage: 1 2 3 a>d
@code
    return skode_exec_args_to_d(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end

